00:05:57,142 --> 00:06:03,142
To keep their sanity in an insane war, they had to be crazy.

2
00:11:54,285 --> 00:12:00,285
The Boys in Company C is a war film directed by Sidney J. Furie.

3
00:17:51,428 --> 00:17:57,428
Disheartened by futile combat, appalled by the corruption of their South Vietnamese ally, and constantly endangered
by the incompetence of their own company commander, the young men find a possible way out of the war.

4
00:23:48,571 --> 00:23:54,571
They are told that if they purposely lose a soccer game against a South Vietnamese team, they
can spend the rest of their tour playing exhibition games behind the lines.

5
