Pfc / Sgt. Tyrone Washington, played by Stan Shaw.

6
00:35:42,857 --> 00:35:48,857
Pvt. Billy Ray Pike, played by Andrew Stevens.

7
00:41:40,000 --> 00:41:46,000
Pvt. Alvin Foster / Narrator, played by James Canning.

8
00:47:37,142 --> 00:47:43,142
Pvt. Vinnie Fazio, played by Michael Lembeck.

9
