01:05:28,571 --> 01:05:34,571
The Boys in Company C is a 1978 war film directed by Sidney J.

12
01:11:25,714 --> 01:11:31,714
Furie about United States Marine Corps recruits preparing for duty
and their subsequent combat in the Vietnam War.

13
01:17:22,857 --> 01:17:28,857
It stars Stan Shaw, Andrew Stevens, Craig Wasson and Michael Lembeck.

14
01:23:20,000 --> 01:23:26,000
It was among the first Vietnam War films to appear after the
Vietnam Era, and was also the first role for R.

15
01:29:17,142 --> 01:29:23,142
Lee Ermey of Full Metal Jacket fame.

16
01:35:14,285 --> 01:35:20,285
It is the first in Furie's Vietnam War motion-picture trilogy,
followed by Under Heavy Fire (2001) and The Veteran (2006).

17
01:41:11,428 --> 01:41:17,428
The film was a co-production of Golden Harvest and Columbia Pictures,
the latter originally handling theatrical distribution.

18
01:47:08,571 --> 01:47:14,571
It was filmed in the Philippines.

19
01:53:05,714 --> 01:53:11,714
Wasson plays guitar and sings the theme song "Here I Am",
used within the film and over the end credits.

20
01:59:02,857 --> 01:59:08,857
The film explores themes of vietnam war, vietnam,
army, football (soccer), basic training.
